 keycard sandbox   welcome





                    ▀  ▀   ▀  ▀     ▄▀▀  ▄▀▀  ▄▀▀     Run an AI agent that never holds a secret.
                    ▀  ▀   ▀  ▀   ▄▀▀  ▄▀▀  ▄▀▀ ▄▀
                    ▀           ▄▀▀  ▄▀▀ ▄▄▀▀ ▄▀▀     The agent runs in a local Kubernetes cluster. Every HTTPS request it makes
                    ▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀ ▄▄▀▀ ▄▀▀  ▄▀▀ ▄▄    goes through the egress proxy, which asks your Keycard zone for the user's
                    ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▀▀  ▄▀▀ ▄▄▀▀ ▄▀▀     credential and adds it on the way out.
                                   ▄▀▀ ▄▀▀  ▄▀▀
                    ▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▄  ▀▀  ▀▀▄          agent ───▶ egress proxy ───▶ api.github.com, openrouter.ai, …
                    ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄  ▀▀▄ ▀▀▄▄ ▀▀▄                       │ ▲
                                 ▀▀▄  ▀▀▄  ▀▀▄ ▀▀▄                     ▼ │  the user's credential
                    ▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▄  ▀▀▄ ▀▀▄  ▀▀▄                    Keycard zone
                    ▀  ▄   ▄  ▄  ▀▀▄  ▀▀▄  ▀▀▄ ▀▀▄
                    ▀  ▀   ▀  ▀    ▀▀▄  ▀▀▄  ▀▀▄ ▀    This machine is not ready
                    ▀  ▀   ▀  ▀      ▀▀   ▀▀   ▀▀       ✕ Docker            Docker is not running
                                                                            Start OrbStack or Docker Desktop.
                                                        ✓ Sandbox images    the release v0.2.1 from ghcr.io/keycardai
                                                        ✓ Tools             k3d, kubectl, helm, cloudflared (from mise.toml)
                                                        ✓ Keycard account   from KEYCARD_CLIENT_ID and KEYCARD_CLIENT_SECRET

                                                      Setup
                                                        1 Keycard account   2 Zone and user     3 Demo
                                                        4 Credentials       5 Cluster
                                                        About three minutes. Setup changes nothing in Keycard, unless you create a
                                                        zone.

